    "You receive a clear next step: extended audit, assessment, roadmap, advisory, implementation support, pause, or no-fit. A no-fit decision is a valid outcome.": "您将获得清晰的下一步：深度审计、评估、路线图、顾问支持、落地支持、暂缓或判定不适合。不适合也是有效结论。",
