    "Is the first conversation really free?": "首次沟通真的免费吗？",
    "Yes. The primary diagnostic is a complimentary 30-45 minute fit review. No obligation, no hidden costs. Paid engagements start only after a separate written proposal.": "是的。初步诊断是免费的30-45分钟契合度评审。无义务，无隐性费用。付费合作仅在另行出具书面方案后才开始。",
    "What do I need to prepare?": "我需要准备什么？",
    "Nothing specific. We ask questions about your current workflows, tools, and pain points. No system access is needed for the initial conversation.": "无需特别准备。我们会询问您当前的工作流、工具和痛点。首次沟通无需系统访问权限。",
    "How quickly can we start?": "多快可以开始？",
    "Most diagnostics are scheduled within a few business days of the request.": "大多数诊断在提交请求后几个工作日内即可安排。",
    "What if you find nothing wrong?": "如果你们什么问题都没发现呢？",
    "Then we tell you. A no-fit decision is a valid and common outcome. We will not manufacture problems to justify an engagement.": "我们会如实告知。不适合也是常见且有效的结论。我们不会凭空制造问题来证明合作的必要性。",

