    "We start with the business process diagnostic to identify automation opportunities - not the other way around.": "我们从业务流程诊断开始，识别自动化机会--而非反过来。",
    "We rank each opportunity by effort, impact, and risk. Only the ones with clear payback make the list.": "我们按投入、影响和风险对每个机会排序。只有回报明确的才会进入清单。",
    "We build the automations, connect your tools, document everything, and hand it over. You own it.": "我们搭建自动化、连接您的工具、记录一切并交付给您。这是您的。",
