    "Timeline: 2-5 weeks depending on the number of workflows, integrations, and tools involved.": "时间：2-5周，取决于工作流、集成和工具的数量。",
    "AI & Automation FAQ": "AI 与自动化常见问题",
    "Do you build custom AI models?": "你们搭建定制 AI 模型吗？",
    "No. We integrate proven tools (GPT, Claude, existing ML services) into your workflows. Custom model training is almost never cost-effective for teams under 250 people.": "不。我们将成熟工具（GPT、Claude、现有 ML 服务）集成到您的工作流中。对于250人以下的团队，定制模型训练几乎从不划算。",
    "What if automation breaks?": "如果自动化出故障怎么办？",
    "Every automation we build includes error handling, logging, and documentation. We hand over monitoring access so your team can manage it independently.": "我们搭建的每一个自动化都包含错误处理、日志记录和文档。我们移交监控访问权限，让您的团队可以独立管理。",
    "Can you automate our specific workflow?": "你们能自动化我们的特定工作流吗？",
    "Probably, but we will not know until the diagnostic. Some workflows should be fixed before they are automated - automating a broken process just breaks it faster.": "很可能可以，但在诊断之前无法确定。有些工作流应该先修复再自动化--自动化一个有缺陷的流程只会让它更快崩溃。",
    "How much time will automation actually save?": "自动化实际能节省多少时间？",
